OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AChris Brown given suspended eight-month
OL,4,Aprison sentence over London nightclub
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FDelivering his sentencing remarks,
OL,8,FJudge Tony Baumgartner says "the
OL,9,Frepeated use" of a bottle was "plainly
OL,10,Fdangerous"
OL,12,FAcknowledging the incident was "short",
OL,13,Fthe judge says it was also "intense".
OL,14,FEarlier, defence barristers said this
OL,15,Fwas an "ugly and unattractive
OL,16,Fincident", adding it "was very
OL,17,Fshort-lived"
OL,19,FThe R&B singer's co-defendant and vocal
OL,20,Fcoach, 40-year-old Omololu Akinlolu,
OL,21,Fgets a four-month sentence - and also
OL,22,Fhas it suspended for a year
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
