OL,3,AHealey to shield low-income pensioners
OL,4,Afrom income tax in the Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FPensioners on low incomes will be
OL,7,Fshielded from income tax by Chancellor
OL,8,FJohn Healey in his first Budget on
OL,9,FWednesday.
OL,11,FThe full, flat-rate state pension is
OL,12,Fexpected to increase by 3.9% to
OL,13,F#13,036.40 a year from April. This
OL,14,Fwould take the payment above the
OL,15,F#12,570 personal tax allowance and
OL,16,Ftherefore be liable for income tax if
OL,17,Fno changes are made.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
